      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Marion’s waterfront hosts one of Massachusetts’ largest recreational sailing fleets, with public beaches, boating, fishing, and shellfish harvesting in Sippican Harbor.",
